OL,3,GNEWSAThe Snowman Christmas trail
OL,4,Aunveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FGiant sculptures of the much-loved
OL,7,Fchildren's book character The Snowman
OL,8,Fhave been placed across a city for an
OL,9,Fart trail.
OL,11,FThe Snowman Trail, led by Bath BID,
OL,12,FWild In Art and Penguin Ventures, will
OL,13,Fsee 12 sculptures, each representing a
OL,14,Fverse from The Twelve Days of
OL,15,FChristmas.
OL,17,FThe project supports the Bath Play
OL,18,FProject, which provides inclusive
OL,19,Fplay-based services for children and
OL,20,Ffamilies across Bath and North East
OL,21,FSomerset.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
