OL,3,GNEWSAThe Snowman Christmas trail
OL,4,Aunveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison Herbert, CEO of Bath BID, said
OL,7,Fshe hopes it encourages visitors to
OL,8,Fexplore the "beautiful city", discover
OL,9,Fnew places and "enjoy a little flurry
OL,10,Fof festive joy ahead of the Christmas
OL,11,Fmarket".
